,"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chinoyenmose","id":320669108,"login":"chinoyenmose","node_id":"U_kgDOEx0FtA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chinoyenmose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chinoyenmose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chinoyenmose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chinoyenmose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chinoyenmose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chinoyenmose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lernza/lernza/commits/066f128053a762b5906aaa26d4e9f81cf5d851df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T22:00:12Z","email":"chinoyenmose@gmail.com","name":"chinoyenmose"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T22:00:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: milestone error recovery, ARIA labels, and loading skeletons\n\nCloses #1720\nCloses #1721\nCloses #1722\nCloses #1725\n\n#1720 — Loading skeletons for leaderboard:\n- Added LeaderboardSkeleton component with animated placeholders\n- Replaced spinner LoadingState with skeleton matching list layout\n- Added aria-live and aria-busy for screen readers\n\n#1721 — Milestone creation error recovery UX:\n- Track createdMilestoneCount and questCreated in component state\n- On partial failure, show ''Created X of Y. Milestone N failed: [error]''\n- Button shows ''Retry remaining N milestones'' after partial failure\n\n#1722 — ARIA labels for accessibility:\n- Added role=progressbar with aria-valuenow/min/max to Progress\n- Added aria-label to milestone status icons (completed/pending/locked)\n- Added aria-hidden=true to decorative icons\n\n#1725 — Contract method name:\n- Verified joinQuest correctly calls join_quest matching contract ABI\n- Old join_with_invite method already removed from frontend\n\nCo-authored-by: Dopey <hello@sshdopey.com>","tree":{"sha":"1999e19cd447ca8e2e6197985394d95baebf79ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lernza/lernza/git/trees/1999e19cd447ca8e2e6197985394d95baebf79ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lernza/lernza/git/commits/066f128053a762b5906aaa26d4e9f81cf5d851df","verification":{"payload":"tree 1999e19cd447ca8e2e6197985394d95baebf79ed\nparent a65c15eb1fa3a1a891d18d68488b4799c41f12f2\nauthor chinoyenmose <chinoyenmose@gmail.com> 1790546412 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790546412 +0100\n\nfix: milestone error recovery, ARIA labels, and loading skeletons\n\nCloses #1720\nCloses #1721\nCloses #1722\nCloses #1725\n\n#1720 — Loading skeletons for leaderboard:\n- Added LeaderboardSkeleton component with animated placeholders\n- Replaced spinner LoadingState with skeleton matching list layout\n- Added aria-live and aria-busy for screen readers\n\n#1721 — Milestone creation error recovery UX:\n- Track createdMilestoneCount and questCreated in component state\n- On partial failure, show ''Created X of Y. Milestone N failed: [error]''\n- Button shows ''Retry remaining N milestones'' after partial failure\n\n#1722 — ARIA labels for accessibility:\n- Added role=progressbar with aria-valuenow/min/max to Progress\n- Added aria-label to milestone status icons (completed/pending/locked)\n- Added aria-hidden=true to decorative icons\n\n#1725 — Contract method name:\n- Verified joinQuest correctly calls join_quest matching contract ABI\n- Old join_with_invite method already removed from frontend\n\nCo-authored-by: Dopey <hello@sshdopey.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquZHsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFb4QAGlJ7Dkp4GpiAXmrvKG661WQ\nVlG4lMeXJY/rpC9mjihbemBcg9o7PP49jRHuKaUHu0HBr+bw0xImjmBpuxouYaBi\nLywZgKa3aJMkX62bPixwV3s4yZD+SOTu5rTiWtoVGd+CqHvFr/CxqAw6m0+XXbaP\nveuFYcaAvzTDgioUvTysSSMkGaom/vtEASsUQE7q1LCHpSEI4OstnGjbOpV+D6nA\nTKiNDldjAGWnUjhjLNp1Yv3M8jZpcWJmzfIlIZFJsiih7amNXjG21j9QPi99IChP\n6rBVDJzySlQ9E21XkFOcR0WC3K7MEi6lfYh