"GitHub"},"message":"feat: batch enrollee removal, standardized events, tag autocomplete, fix unwrap()\n\n…fix unwrap()\n\nCloses #1620 - Add batch_remove_enrollees to quest contract\n- batch_remove_enrollees() removes multiple enrollees in one tx\n- Respects leave-hold constraints (blocked list returned, not errored)\n- Idempotent for non-enrolled addresses\n- Emits individual enrollee_removed events per removal with actor+timestamp\n- Auto-promotes from waitlist via existing internal_remove_enrollee\n- 3 new tests: happy path, hold blocking, idempotency\n\nCloses #1634 - Add indexer-friendly metadata to all events\n- common: emit_quest_created now includes ledger timestamp\n- common: emit_reward_funded/emit_reward_distributed include timestamp\n- common: new helpers emit_enrollee_added, emit_enrollee_removed,\n  emit_milestone_created, emit_milestone_completed all include\n  quest_id, actor, and timestamp in event data\n- quest: enrollee_removed events now emit (quest_id, enrollee, actor, ts)\n- quest: join_quest_with_invite enrollee_added includes full schema\n- milestone: milestone_created uses shared helper with actor+timestamp\n- milestone: milestone_completed uses shared helper with actor+timestamp\n\nCloses #1635 - Tag search with autocomplete on dashboard\n- selectedTags state: array of active tag filters\n- tagFilterMode state: AND / OR toggle\n- allKnownTags derived from loaded quests for autocomplete suggestions\n- tagSuggestions computed from tagInput against known tags\n- tagFilteredQuests applies AND/OR multi-tag filtering after text search\n- UI: input with dropdown suggestions, removable chip per active tag,\n  AND/OR toggle shown when 2+ tags active, Clear all button\n- 4 new frontend tests covering single-tag filter, chip removal,\n  multi-tag OR mode\n\nCloses #1636 - Audit and reduce unwrap() in rewards contract\n- claim_batch Phase 2 loop: replaced .unwrap() with .ok_or(Error::InvalidInput)\n  for both milestone_ids.get(i) and amounts.get(i)\n- All remaining .unwrap_or(0) calls are safe optional counter reads\n  and are documented as such\n\nCo-authored-by: Dopey <hello@sshdopey.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee68971f12bdb47cd03e7d4dacfe810713fcd19f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lernza/lernza/git/trees/ee68971f12bdb47cd03e7d4dacfe810713fcd19f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lernza/lernza/git/commits/ca054aedda0974d2d316d1cd10ecdfbb9e3a073f","verification":{"payload":"tree ee68971f12bdb47cd03e7d4dacfe810713fcd19f\nparent f7ceeb3008d05175dcb9f471c6ba67e7c8652197\nauthor Dev. Fashman <jajafwangshak86@gmail.com> 1790502856 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790502856 +0100\n\nfeat: batch enrollee removal, standardized events, tag autocomplete, fix unwrap()\n\n…fix unwrap()\n\nCloses #1620 - Add batch_remove_enrollees to quest contract\n- batch_remove_enrollees() removes multiple enrollees in one tx\n- Respects leave-hold constraints (blocked list returned, not errored)\n- Idempotent for non-enrolled addresses\n- Emits individual enrollee_removed events per removal with actor+timestamp\n- Auto-promotes from waitlist via existing internal_remove_enrollee\n- 3 new tests: happy path, hold blocking, idempotency\n\nCloses #1634 - Add indexer-friendly metadata to all events\n- common: emit_quest_created now includes ledger timestamp\n- common: emit_reward_funded/emit_reward_distributed include timestamp\n- common: new helpers emit_enrollee_added, emit_enrollee_removed,\n  emit_milestone_created, emit_milestone_completed all include\n  quest_id, actor, and timestamp in event data\n- quest: enrollee_removed events now emit (quest_id, enrollee, actor, ts)\n- quest: join_quest_with_invite enrollee_added includes full schema\n- milestone: milestone_created uses shared helper with actor+timestamp\n- milestone: milestone_completed uses shared helper with actor+timestamp\n\nCloses #1635 - Tag search with autocomplete on dashboard\n- selectedTags state: array of active tag filters\n- tagFilterMode state: AND / OR toggle\n- allKnownTags derived from loaded quests for autocomplete suggestions\n- tagSuggestions computed from tagInput against known tags\n- tagFilteredQuests applies AND/OR multi-tag filtering after text search\n- UI: input with dropdown suggestions, removable chip per active tag,\n  AND/OR toggle shown when 2+ tags active, Clear all button\n- 4 new frontend tests covering single-tag filter, chip removal,\n  multi-tag OR mode\n\nCloses #1636 - Audit and reduce unwrap() in rewards contract\n- claim_batch Phase 2 loop: replaced .unwrap() with .ok_or(Error::InvalidInput)\n  for both milestone_ids.get(i) and amounts.get(i)\n- All remaining .unwrap_or(0) calls are safe optional counter reads\n  and are documented as such\n\nCo-authored-by: Dopey <hello@sshdopey.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquOfICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjOgQAHsziyrP3TDrEk5Rq8HIVqaY\nByrtQxALEtRRfeqrdfO/3tMA3iWIfIgTCaDo9jxAUzkejyZ6FprjPxz68A1A9bmq\n1GZV+O80Ys8xDbcW2ihvaNKBEUtGqKNE3F9MnVqIohN2484eUE+zqn+fwWXaUqvN\nlcfa1yU1TmtcSN0tVfk3upuBS2gG62J7mRcruOkmbvFaPtOa/1ZuCaEgbK47HAY3\nqv9b3RKXBlc7g2/7f9vkX9UkV7kVoppsrO+QSkeLQ+PVSIF/iDeHINX3iVUYH8Ar\nVq7M3Koc893rqvbcB3FmkZfenD3xKx3ZmlWiQ3txAlbyRMVIHHhU6UU6sRSnXMyA\nq8zJSSvKnytDxpbupo8bo6/t/apTql7V2ZA7LWuMBPX0RR4794clU1PWv38gvy23\nDm06pGYhGgvnd3HSZ1Qy7F5mUJ9JUpXY0eu+VF3uv+K/9N1/4EpXKoQivbGAwi49\namPg/ynuvzQr1tMr/d03Nj5FIV+whefxzghMflCVAlb7X/nbomp0Np+6sv4EdJg9\nlYgg6h5Z1AYBPdajGzLttLfEKx27Q0P9GJo/rtK8EkauA2eA8zQj2nPDuoNkJX7s\nc/zj/JUZFrY1LC2tS9CVzNfn8ZtQT8ZLIuZZaQrQNVsSA27/KQptbXGEhALVM1Vw\nLsqQEqvox13zJ2bw0J3Q\n=4ZeU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T09:54:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://a