mine the reward rules without extra contract calls\n- peer_approved now includes verification_mode and approval_count\n  providing a complete audit trail at the point of the final approval\n- Clone mode/verification_mode before their consuming match expressions\n  so the values remain available at the event emit site\n\nCo-authored-by: Dopey <hello@sshdopey.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5bcfe6b8b996d8e168359f3e152c4ab71cee3a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lernza/lernza/git/trees/f5bcfe6b8b996d8e168359f3e152c4ab71cee3a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lernza/lernza/git/commits/a2bce6c1c3bbe55c038162d0913f3bc05332428a","verification":{"payload":"tree f5bcfe6b8b996d8e168359f3e152c4ab71cee3a1\nparent 3affc249fd4b1b19406a4cc9c59342745011094a\nauthor abdulsamadr943-code <abdulsamadr943@gmail.com> 1787946272 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787946272 +0100\n\nfix(milestone): enrich milestone_completed and peer_approved events\n\n- milestone_completed now includes reward (i128) and distribution_mode\n  so indexers can determine the reward rules without extra contract calls\n- peer_approved now includes verification_mode and approval_count\n  providing a complete audit trail at the point of the final approval\n- Clone mode/verification_mode before their consuming match expressions\n  so the values remain available at the event emit site\n\nCo-authored-by: Dopey <hello@sshdopey.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkeUgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwAMQADU6N5eS0yFwGS2CpuJ4kuIm\nODixvZog2AI+/TRJJjz62oXwMFqlFueLQknf7oik5kM5U9HW1abfwWj7iTH13Tai\n4hULIxRJRyc2F3CBEQ9sYf8gbPrclHzRvA4HdL2rBb1ZFcvXyi15HQyihnXOn8I1\nSZyIzIR90d2Ynw1OJnmpfQMbpfkgIFxk85bPs76B8k9pGgPOo7yc3eUgmMEmu0B5\niDBiql5b0QnPmfBEqgjuylhEzwgrKMRUz9bDfd5hFfEQU1u8t0vmotn3yspgeLB2\nJAQzwjEXLCmoq3fEUlponm2+L6Dd6K2UC2iaPib70ONsXG4+jl/5j3/AuRk6HOo6\nu69dk7MOEclw3XCNUCjCas1JBkNbFl6NoxWPa2WVdi1c6/+By3jL3HGJQ7O7YPjc\nJI1uF/EHYCN/wHiWXu1mWld3EI7Xjp144KaRc1XM8I52Ym7odb7sBL+iLw1n