","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ-Min/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ-Min/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ-Min/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ-Min","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agentic-AI-Busan/AI-RAG-Server/commits/6b9b2a8caa10dc05988af35bd531abcf866474af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-15T07:14:48Z","email":"alsrudwls1217@gmail.com","name":"KyungjinMin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-15T07:14:48Z","email":"alsrudwls1217@gmail.com","name":"KyungjinMin"},"message":"feat(streamlit): Implement Streamlit chatbot UI, Docker integration, and documentation (#9)\n\n- Add initial Streamlit chatbot UI:\n    - Basic structure, page configuration, title, chat message display.\n    - Session state for chat history, user input field.\n- Implement API integration for chatbot responses:\n    - Connect to backend API (/route-test).\n    - Send user query and chat history, process and display API responses.\n    - Add error handling for API calls.\n- Configure Dockerization for Streamlit app:\n    - Create Dockerfile using python:3.10-slim.\n    - Install dependencies, expose port 8501, define entrypoint.\n- Integrate Streamlit app service into Docker Compose:\n    - Add streamlit_app service to docker-compose.yml.\n    - Configure build, ports, volumes, API_BASE_URL environment variable.\n    - Correct YAML syntax for environment variables.\n- Improve and fix Streamlit chatbot:\n    - Correct API endpoint path in app.py to /route-test.\n    - Remove empty \"View Sources\" display from UI.\n- Create technical guide for Streamlit chatbot UI:\n    - Add streamlit_chatbot_guide.md detailing setup, logic, and execution.","tree":{"sha":"a132ed86fa996b79cfdeb516c4f1a9b2db34cbe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agentic-AI-Busan/AI-RAG-Server/git/trees/a132ed86fa996b79cfdeb516c4f1a9