89a7462502c7b1347"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/commits/a71c1694fdb916924834a0eca3bb73752cc91190/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T12:29:10Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T12:29:10Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"message":"Dev-Harness: security.yaml ohne Admin-Bundle-Firewall, nur noch Studio\n\nNach dem Composer-Fix scheiterte der Kernel-Boot mit \"non-existent parameter\npimcore_admin_bundle.firewall_settings\": das klassische Admin-Bundle ist in Pimcore 2026\nnicht mehr installiert, die Firewall `pimcore_admin` und die /admin-Access-Control-Regeln\nzeigten ins Leere. Die Datei entspricht jetzt dem Harness von cors/pimcore-sso mit der\nStudio-Firewall, unter der auch Adminer (/pimcore-studio/api/cors-adminer) liegt;\n`enable_authenticator_manager` ist in Symfony 7 kein Schlüssel mehr.","tree":{"sha":"2e9419f2ee0d5277f3ead81086858be69cf2303f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/git/trees/2e9419f2ee0d5277f3ead81086858be69cf2303f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/git/commits/a71c1694fdb916924834a0eca3bb73752cc91190","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/commit/a71c1694fdb916924834a0eca3bb73752cc91190","node_id":"C_kwDOODrFyNoAKGE3MWMxNjk0ZmRiOTE2OTI0ODM0YTBlY2EzYmI3Mzc1MmNjOTExOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/commit/50c092554c1fee863611b78dd042ab4c697a823c","sha":"50c092554c1fee863611b78dd042ab4c697a823c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/commits/50c092554c1fee863611b78dd042ab4c697a823c"}],"sha":"a71c1694fdb916924834a0eca3bb73752cc91190","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/commits/a71c1694fdb916924834a0eca3bb73752cc91190"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/commits/50c092554c1fee863611b78dd042ab4c697a823c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T12:27:28Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T12:27:28Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"message":"composer: Adminer-Advisory PKSA-5hbx-ykrq-c4p8 ignorieren, opensearch-client auf 2026, SimpleBackendSearch raus\n\nComposer löst vrana/adminer ^4.17 nicht mehr auf, weil 4.17.x von\nPKSA-5hbx-ykrq-c4p8 (CVE-2026-25892, unauthentifizierter DoS über ?script=version)\nbetroffen ist und die Advisory-Policy betroffene Versionen blockiert. Upstream ist das\nerst in 5.4.2 behoben; 5.x/6.x verschieben aber die komplette Plugin-API in den\nNamespace Adminer\\ (Adminer\\Plugin statt \\AdminerPlugin, adminer/index.php ebenfalls\nnamespaced), das Bundle hängt sich in DefaultController und lib/Pim mit der 4.x-API\nein und müsste dafür umgeschrieben werden. Deshalb wird die Advisory per\nconfig.policy.advisories.ignore-id mit Begründung ignoriert: Adminer wird nur hinter der\nPimcore-Admin-Prüfung des Controllers ausgeliefert, der unauthentifizierte Endpunkt ist\nnicht erreichbar. Das Update auf Adminer 6 bleibt eine eigene Aufgabe.\n\nZusätzlich blockierten zwei weitere Reste aus Pimcore 12 dieselbe CI:\npimcore/opensearch-client ^2.1 verlangt pimcore/pimcore ^12 und kollidiert mit ^2026.2\n(jetzt ^2026.1, wie es studio-backend-bundle mitbringt), und das in config/bundles.php\nregistrierte SimpleBackendSearchBundle existiert in Pimcore 2026 nicht mehr (weder im\nCore noch auf Packagist), der Kernel-Boot wäre daran gescheitert.","tree":{"sha":"8e5c97c5fc73267fb38d82f4a101cbe1a91ff379","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/git/trees/8e5c97c5fc73267fb38d82f4a101cbe1a91ff379"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/git/commits/50c092554c1fee863611b78dd042ab4c697a823c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/commit/50c092554c1fee863611b78dd042ab4c697a823c","node_id":"C_kwDOODrFyNoAKDUwYzA5MjU1NGMxZmVlODYzNjExYjc4ZGQwNDJhYjRjNjk3YTgyM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/commit/d84da2bbbaec2941a0b90fa2b25f51a4b283b873","sha":"d84da2bbbaec2941a0b90fa2b25f51a4b283b873","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/commits/d84da2bbbaec2941a0b90fa2b25f51a4b283b873"}],"sha":"50c092554c1fee863611b78dd042ab4c697a823c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/commits/50c092554c1fee863611b78dd042ab4c697a823c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/commits/d84da2bbbaec2941a0b90fa2b25f51a4b283b873/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T11:36:37Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T11:36:37Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"message":"CI: Static Tests auf Shared-Workflow php-test mit Lizenzkonfiguration umstellen\n\nDer bisherige Caller coreshop/workflow-collection erwartet CoreShop-Org-Secrets\n(PIMCORE_SECRET, ...), die es in cors-gmbh nicht gibt, und triggerte nur auf\nmain statt auf dem Default-Branch 2026.x. Der Workflow ruft jetzt\ncors-gmbh/shared-workflows php-test auf (Trigger *.x + workflow_dispatch),\nliest die PHP-Version aus DOCKER_PHP_VERSION in .env und reicht die drei\nRepository-Secrets PIMCORE_ENCRYPTION_SECRET, PIMCORE_INSTANCE_IDENTIFIER und\nPIMCORE_PRODUCT_KEY per env_local an .env.local durch.\n\nDamit der Kernel für PHPStan/Psalm überhaupt bootet, bekommt die Test-App ein\nconfig/license.yaml mit pimcore.encryption und pimcore.product_registration\naus Env-Variablen, leere Defaults in config/config.yaml, den Instance\nIdentifier in .env und einen README-Hinweis, woher Secret und Product Key\nkommen.\n\nCloses #13","tree":{"sha":"4b86b9383fb97b3639b0b4062bbe7d3133c08fa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/git/trees/4b86b9383fb97b3639b0b4062bbe7d3133c08fa7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-adminer/git/commits/d84da2bbbaec2941a0b90fa2b25f51a4b283b873","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https